OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Flimited brighter spells. Although
OL,7,Flargely dry there may be some light
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle. Light
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThrough the evening and
OL,12,Fovernight it will remain cloudy across
OL,13,Fall parts with a few light outbreaks
OL,14,Fof rain and drizzle possible, but
OL,15,Fpredominantly dry.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FIt will be a dry day with
OL,18,Fbright and sunny spells developing
OL,19,Flater after a cloudy start.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
